   "copper": 48,
   "description": "You came through this jungle listening for danger; now the jungle knows your footsteps. Travel to Tornstandard Hold on Bannerbreak Mesa and report to Yarra Standardmender; she sends Throng fighters on to the front from there. Carry our thunder with you.",
